# End-to-end walkthrough of the four endpoints, plus one error case each.
# Start the service first:  dotnet run --project src/Host   (Swagger UI: http://localhost:5000/swagger)
# Run top to bottom: ids flow between requests via named-request variables
# (supported by the VS Code REST Client extension, Visual Studio 2022 17.12+ and JetBrains Rider).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Create a user -> 201 { id } + Location: /users/{id}
# The random suffix keeps re-runs from hitting the uniqueness rule (409).
# @name createUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Alice_{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}"
}

### 1a. Error: invalid username -> 400 problem details (users.username.invalid_length)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ab"
}

### 2. Get the user just created -> 200 { id, username }
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{createUser.response.body.$.id}}

### 2a. Error: unknown user id -> 404 problem details (users.not_found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{$guid}}

### 3. Create a work item for that user -> 201 { id }
# @name createWorkItem
POST {{baseUrl}}/work-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Write the README",
  "assigneeId": "{{createUser.response.body.$.id}}"
}

### 3b. Create a second work item (sorts first by name in the list below)
POST {{baseUrl}}/work-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Add architecture tests",
  "assigneeId": "{{createUser.response.body.$.id}}"
}

### 3a. Error: assignee does not exist -> 422 problem details (workitems.assignee.not_found)
POST {{baseUrl}}/work-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Orphaned task",
  "assigneeId": "{{$guid}}"
}

### 4. List the user's work items -> 200 [ ... ] ordered by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/work-items?assigneeId={{createUser.response.body.$.id}}

### 4a. Error: missing assigneeId -> 400 problem details (workitems.assignee.required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/work-items

### 4b. Not an error: unknown user -> 200 [] (decision #3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/work-items?assigneeId={{$guid}}
